  "body": "From the review of PR #1528 (#1514, operation picking as a mode): `interact::op_pick_locked` unlocks picking off the Geometry tab while a pick is armed. Only the boundary-pick exemption is pinned. Dropping the points-draft exemption, or the box-pick disarm while locked, leaves every test green.\n\n**Expected:** one structural UI test per armed source (boundary pick, locate draft, points draft, WCS circle pick, WCS/plane/axis collecting drafts) showing that it unlocks picking off the Geometry tab, plus a test that a box drag is ignored while locked. Each is mutation-checked.\n\n**Done means:** deleting any one armed-flag term in `op_pick_locked`, or the `box_pick::armed` lock check, turns a test red.\n\nRelated: #1514, PR #1528.\n",
